  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.1.0: Changed from using ImageSharp to FFmpeg.Magick due to license issues.\n      v8.1.5: Changed the video thumbnail creator to ThumbGen.Magick with ffmpeg v8.\n      v8.1.6: Adjust FFmpeg.GPL package to last ffmpeg v8.1.\n      v8.1.7: Add check for video thumbnails to make sure is video extension.\n      v8.1.10: Clean up video thumbs extra jpg files created to make thumbnails for videos.\n      v8.1.11: Make popup size the size of the image or video when displayed.\n      v8.1.13: Fix video size not working.\n      v8.1.15: Security updates and latest Nuget packages.",
